&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;House entered DOC custody on May 22, 2020, from Clackamas County with an earliest release date of July 9, 2039. House was 64 years old. Next of kin has been notified.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;DOC takes all in-custody deaths seriously. The agency is responsible for the care and custody of approximately 12,000 individuals who are incarcerated in 12 institutions across the state. While crime information is public record, DOC elects to disclose only upon request out of respect for any family or victims.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SRCI is a multi-custody prison in Ontario. Additional information about the Oregon Department of Corrections can be found at &lt;a href="http://www.oregon.gov/doc"&gt;www.oregon.gov/doc&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

