&lt;p style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMALL BUSINESS ENTREPRENEURS RECEIVE $903,000 INVESTMENT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thriving Entrepreneurs Grants from Oregon Community Foundation&amp;nbsp;Power&amp;nbsp;Development, Support&amp;nbsp;Rural&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Underrepresented&amp;nbsp;Innovators&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Breaking into business has never been easy.&amp;nbsp;Forty-two new&amp;nbsp;grants&amp;nbsp;distributed&amp;nbsp;this month from Oregon Community Foundation&rsquo;s&amp;nbsp;Thriving Entrepreneurs program&amp;nbsp;aim&amp;nbsp;to smooth the path for&amp;nbsp;rural and unrepresented innovators&amp;nbsp;and small business owners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;The program, in its fifth year, has awarded&amp;nbsp;just over&amp;nbsp;$3.5 million&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;nonprofit&amp;nbsp;organizations that&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;entrepreneurs&amp;nbsp;of all ages&amp;nbsp;with capital, connections,&amp;nbsp;curriculum,&amp;nbsp;coaching and more.&amp;nbsp;This year, 79% of grants&amp;nbsp;went&amp;nbsp;to organizations that are based in rural communities or&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;serve them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&ldquo;Oregonians are bursting with business ideas.&amp;nbsp;Yet&amp;nbsp;to get to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;market,&amp;nbsp;they often need help developing business plans,&amp;nbsp;accessing&amp;nbsp;funding&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;building capacity,&rdquo; said Jocelyn Beh, Economic Vitality and Housing Program Officer for Oregon Community Foundation. &ldquo;They're already doing the&amp;nbsp;hard work&amp;nbsp;of building Oregon&rsquo;s economy.&amp;nbsp;They just need a boost from organizations like the ones supported by Thriving Entrepreneurs.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2025 Grantees&amp;nbsp;Include Organizations Supporting Food Innovators&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Food and beverage industry&amp;nbsp;leaders&amp;nbsp;&mdash;&amp;nbsp;including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;former Stumptown Coffee Roasters and Dutch Bros. Coffee CEO&amp;nbsp;Joth&amp;nbsp;Ricci, an OCF Board member&amp;nbsp;&mdash;&amp;nbsp;last week&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW186342739 BCX0" href="https://oregonbusinessplan.org/2025-leadership-summit/" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size:12pt"&gt;called&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;more&amp;nbsp;investment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;in the state&rsquo;s culinary future.&amp;nbsp;Several&amp;nbsp;Thriving Entrepreneurs grants went to&amp;nbsp;nonprofits that support&amp;nbsp;farms&amp;nbsp;or restauranters,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;help&amp;nbsp;food businesses&amp;nbsp;launch,&amp;nbsp;build&amp;nbsp;markets&amp;nbsp;or scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;One such grantee, Ecotrust&rsquo;s Resilient Food Futures program, supports businesses across Oregon. Their signature event, Local Link, connects small food businesses with institutional buyers such as school districts and hospitals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&ldquo;Local Link has&amp;nbsp;truly changed the direction of my small business,&rdquo; said Lucy De Le&oacute;n, owner of Salsas Locas.&amp;nbsp;&ldquo;We&rsquo;re&amp;nbsp;proudly serving 18 school districts with tamales, enchiladas, breakfast items, and now pozole. As a Latina-owned business, this program opened real doors for us. It helped us grow, hire locally and work with Oregon producers who care about quality as much as we do.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Another Thriving Entrepreneurs grant supports the Heppner Community Foundation, which serves&amp;nbsp;remote&amp;nbsp;south&amp;nbsp;Morrow County.&amp;nbsp;The foundation manages a business innovation hub, commercial&amp;nbsp;kitchen&amp;nbsp;and retail store, among other&amp;nbsp;services. Some entrepreneurs there hope to bring a farmer&rsquo;s market back to the area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus on Building Networks&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;Beh said this year&rsquo;s grants include a focus on building networks for small business owners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;For example,&amp;nbsp;Coalici&oacute;n&amp;nbsp;Forteleza&amp;nbsp;in the Rogue Valley will launch a Latino Entrepreneurship Network and&amp;nbsp;Be BLAC&amp;nbsp;will continue to sustain&amp;nbsp;its network&amp;nbsp;of Black businesses and leaders in the Salem area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:georgia,serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW186342739 BCX0" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
