&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Klamath County, Ore. (Dec. 17, 2025)-&lt;/strong&gt; On Tuesday, December 16, 2025, at 6:40 p.m., Oregon State Police responded to a two-vehicle crash on Highway 97, near milepost 255, in Klamath County.&lt;/p&gt;

