&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The operator of the Chevrolet (Gilmer) and passenger, Christian Octavio Rodriguez (28) of Rosamond (CA), suffered reported minor injuries. A second passenger of the Chevrolet, James Devon Cozart Jr. (19) of Rancho Cordova (CA) was reportedly uninjured.&lt;/p&gt;

